# kin/child/head/ears_human: the child's human ears
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to KIN-CHILD in wave 2). The child, 21 px (STYLE_P2 3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role ears human
layer head
anchor head
keys rest
z 1

view D key rest origin 1 -5
|q............q
|q............q

view U key rest origin 1 -5
|q...........q
|q...........q

view R key rest origin -5 -5
|ts
|sr

view L key rest origin -6 -5
|tt
|rs
